      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Combining Ambien with alcohol is a very bad idea and can be dangerous. Alcohol and Ambien both depress your central nervous system, so mixing them can lead to excessive drowsiness, impaired coordination, and even respiratory depression. For better sleep, I strongly recommend sticking to the prescribed dosage of your medication alone. If you're still struggling with sleep, please discuss safe alternatives with your healthcare provider.",
