      "content": "but my doctor didn't say anything about wine, they just said to take the pill and stay away from heavy drinking. if i'm just having one small glass to relax, is that considered \"heavy\"? feels like im being way too paranoid. can you just be real with me, is it actually going to cause a medical emergency or is it just a standard warning?",
