      "content": "It is wise to be cautious, as the warning against mixing alcohol and Ambien is very serious, regardless of the amount consumed. Even a small amount can dangerously enhance the depressant effects of the medication, leading to unpredictable sedation or impaired function. This isn't just a standard warning; the combination can potentially cause serious issues like severe dizziness or difficulty breathing. To be absolutely safe, avoid the alcohol entirely while taking your sleep aid.",
